  "measurement_scope": "Deterministic local regression and mutation controls only. No new provider/model calls, historical regrading, full application Rust run, native Windows/macOS or healthy Browser/card visual E2E. Full ready-PR CI remains a separate publication-time check.",
  "dispositions": {
    "major_1a": "All current presentation graders share the existing turn-bounded, ID/result-paired audit helper; event.failed must be explicitly false, and the exact path must belong to that same event. Product and transcript lists are never zipped. Unknown results cannot pass.",
