    "major_1c": "New V1/V2 live rows carry grader_revision. Manifests cover every delegated case generation and reject cross-source resume; historical runner-specific acceptance/browser policies stay explicitly versioned. No historical row is rewritten.",
    "major_2": "Use the actual merged f1eb10efc baseline; refresh current README/PR state and add linked supersession banners/past tense to candidate history. Preserve snapshot body with an explicit current-source pointer. Mark ready after checked publication so full applicable CI can run.",
    "major_3": "Independently assert canonical todo_write/content/pending/success-before-card Plan guidance; browser error names must be fully backtick-delimited, with production-emission checks retained.",
    "minor_1": "Correct stale deferred-presenter comment.",
    "minor_2": "Use consistent artifact-card and tool-catalog terminology in current model-facing sources.",
    "minor_3": "CI explicitly opts into exact Gitleaks allowance controls with the already pinned binary, and provider-free Linux namespace acceptance.",
    "minor_4": "Both summarizers share family completeness/duplicate validation; a synthetic two-turn failure catches all-to-any inflation in each implementation.",
    "minor_5": "Every bound session receives the stable scope caveat even when the primary chain has no rule files. Loading boundaries and unbound behavior remain unchanged.",
    "minor_6": "Retain all user-requested reports/figures; mark SVG generated and disable textual SVG/PNG diffs.",
    "minor_7": "Record the persistent eager-presenter schema cost in design/PR prose as a reviewer estimate, not a new model measurement.",
    "minor_8": "Add five app-side regression fingerprints and replace the generic peer-case tuple needle with its marker condition. The existing composer fingerprint covers bundle integration.",
    "minor_9": "Preserve invalid/timeout stdout separately, recover only an unterminated JSONL tail with original-byte backup after revision checks, allow only protocol headers through the proxy, identify frozen evaluator copies in their README and explain historical generation imports. No broad case-framework rewrite.",
    "minor_10": "Move the evidence index ahead of condensed review bookkeeping; avoid repeating headline numbers."
